<title>USA: Reuters day-to-day muni calendar slips to $402 mln.</title>
<headline>Reuters day-to-day muni calendar slips to $402 mln.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-09-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Reuters day-to-day municipal bond sales calendar fell to $402 million in nine offerings from $1.365 billion, according to Reuters Municipal Bond Information Group.</p>
<p>The largest issue on the calendar is a $100 million Wisconsin health issue through Merrill Lynch &amp; Co.</p>
<p>--U.S. Municipal Desk, 212-859-1650</p>
</text>
